    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d409">

                <pb facs="0458" n="358" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg358"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.2311/145</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Peruvian Appointed Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Pezet</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation<anchor n="2" xml:id="d409-f1"
                    />]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-12-17"><hi rendition="#italic">December 17,
                        1919</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to place in Your
                    Excellency’s hands copies of the autograph letters<anchor n="3" xml:id="d409-f2"
                    /> of His Excellency the President of Peru which accredit me Ambassador
                    Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary of Peru to the United States of America, as
                    well as those of recall of my distinguished predecessor, Doctor Francisco
                    Tudela.</p>
                <p>I am retaining the original of the said letters of credence and of recall in
                    order to deliver them to His Excellency the President of the <pb facs="0459"
                        n="359" xml:id="pg359"/> United States of America in the formal audience
                    which, when his shattered health shall permit, and for whose rapid restoration I
                    offer my sincere prayers, Your Excellency will arrange for me.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. A. Pezet</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
